{# ─── Category Definition Section ─────────────── #}
<section class="page-section text-center">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="section-label" data-aos="fade-up">Category</span>
    <h2 class="section-headline" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="50">
      The Product Decision Platform
    </h2>
    <div class="section-body" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
      <p>Analytics tools produce dashboards. Warehouses produce reports. CDPs produce segments. None of them produce <strong style="color: #f1f5f9;">decisions</strong>.</p>
      <p>You might call it a personalization engine, a real-time CDP, or a recommendation platform. We call it a Product Decision Platform because it does all three. Signals go in, decisions come out, and your data never has to leave the database.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

