      <div class="col" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="150">
        <div class="truth-card truth-blue">
          <h5>No data movement</h5>
          <p>Signals are processed where your operational data already lives. No extraction, no transformation, no third-party access. Your data stays in your database, under your control.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200">
        <div class="truth-card truth-purple">
          <h5>No pipeline orchestration</h5>
          <p>Behavioral signals converge continuously inside the database. Other platforms need Airflow, dbt, or custom ETL just to stitch data together.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="250">
        <div class="truth-card truth-teal">
          <h5>Decisions run with the data</h5>
